              <div style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#7dd3fc;font-weight:700;">COMPUTER NETWORKING · WEEK 1 / DAY 03</div>
              <h1 style="margin:8px 0 10px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.3;color:#ffffff;">IPv4/IPv6, subnet, CIDR</h1>
              <p style="margin:0;color:#d5edf7;font-size:16px;">주소를 외우지 않고 binary prefix와 route lookup으로 읽기 · 예상 학습 35분 + 실습 25분</p>
            </td>
